#! case: a 1.5 build names a construct of a later system as Regia 2.0, and checks it no further
#! rule: R01_09-later-regia-construct
#! regia: 1.5

GAME CUE insult_heard(speaker)
ACTION complain

PLAYBOOK Guest:
    WHEN insult_heard(?), FROM GAME:     #! error R01_09-later-regia-construct
        DO complain.
